                <pb facs="0115" n="109" sameAs="frus:frus1894app1/pg109"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Gresham to Mr. Bayard.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1893-09-19"><hi rendition="#italic">September 19,
                        1893</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Referring to my telegram of the 16th
                    instant instructing you in regard to the framing of regulations and legislation
                    on the part of the United States and Great Britain to govern sealing in Bering
                    Sea, I send you for your further information copies of the final decision of the
                    Tribunal of Arbitration with the recommendations made by the tribunal to the two
                    Governments.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">W. Q. Gresham.</hi></signed></closer>







